      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_card::000::ade5504bfd"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The FCC/B2 interfaces in the initial Al0.7CoCrFeNi alloy are incoherent.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The baseline alloy has high strength but less than 5% tensile elongation.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::rubric_card::000::6a984a21e0"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stress concentration at incoherent FCC/B2 interfaces causes the baseline brittleness and interfacial fracture.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Treatment at 6 GPa and 1473 K for 2 hours will transform the lamellae into a hierarchically patterned microstructure with coherent FCC/B2 interfaces.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed topological transformation is driven by pressure-enhanced diffusion.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "High pressure lowers the activation energy for atomic diffusion and interface migration in this alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interfacial-energy minimization converts the incoherent interfaces into coherent interfaces.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Conventional thermal treatment alone cannot produce the proposed pressure-induced coherent hierarchical structure.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent FCC/B2 interfaces allow dislocations to transfer across phase boundaries rather than pile up.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dislocation transfer across coherent interfaces reduces crack-initiating stress concentrations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hierarchical pattern supplies multiple length scales for dislocation storage and interaction.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The transformed structure enables dislocation glide, stacking faults, and twinning.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coherent hierarchical structure promotes strain hardening and homogeneous deformation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::rubric_card::000::2d68b747c3",
        "PMC5995863::rubric_card::000::6a984a21e0"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HPHT-treated alloy will exceed 20% tensile elongation.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HPHT-treated alloy will maintain or slightly increase yield strength relative to the baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
